[en.FOCUS_C12_REVENGE_CRUSADE]
Revenge Crusade

[en.FOCUS_C12_REVENGE_CRUSADE_desc]
The long-awaited opportunity has finally arrived, and a preemptive strike against the Empire will be launched at last.\nLet the Empire burn in the flames of revenge. For sister! For parents! For the family!

[zh.FOCUS_C12_REVENGE_CRUSADE]
复仇圣战

[zh.FOCUS_C12_REVENGE_CRUSADE_desc]
期待已久的时机已经成熟，对帝国的突袭战争终于将要展开。\n让帝国在复仇的怒火中燃烧，为了妹妹！为了父母！为了家族！

